{"id":"n80660-1-8","stage":5,"title":"친근하다 · 亲近","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80660-1-8-1","ko":"너희 둘이 꽤 친근하게 지내더라?","zh":"你们俩相处得挺亲近啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"둘이","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘이","audio":"/audio/2ef3d078f170aff7e805.mp3"}},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}},{"text":"친근하게","meaning":"亲近，亲密","explanation":"친근하다：亲近，亲密；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"친근하다","audio":"/audio/60800c6b65bbfe559848.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80660","senseId":"1","lemma":"친근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친근하게","audio":"/audio/24ea7690b6897e2517eb.mp3"}},{"text":"지내더라?","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내더라","audio":"/audio/98fd130606ec52e3a6f7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","